      "adventureEffect": "None",
      "difficulty": "3★",
      "text": "<p>On each Necrozma Dawn Wings (NDW) cast shadow claw and aim for 2-3 Moongeist Beams. If the active NDW is too low hp to build another Moongeist Beam, switch to the next one. If Lunala is casting Shadow Ball, dodge each shadow ball. Moongeist Beam and Shadow Ball both share identical animation durations (3.0s). If you're at risk of Shadow Ball occurring at the same time, pre-dodging can help protect the Moongeist beam cast.</p><p><br></p><p><em>Note: The VOD provided uses level 50 NDW however the TTW above is scaled to Level 40 appropriately.</em> <em>Strategy remains the same. </em></p>",
